    "name": "Crash Pandas",
    "steam_appid": 3349140,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349140/extras/1c211d9f3851ca389f8f05615bb2617b.avif?t=1751264125\" data-has-big width=800 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349140/extras/d953a1406e9ec38a125b08122e8738de.avif?t=1751264125\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Crash Pandas</i>, you play as speed-loving raccoons hijacking cars and racing through chaotic downhill streets. Fight for control of vehicles, sabotage your friends, and dodge the ruthless Wrecker authorities in fast-paced party-racing mayhem online or on the couch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349140/extras/5193650e62c1cdb45f28fdaa775f5729.avif?t=1751264125\" data-has-big width=800 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop into any car you find (or kick out another raccoon) to take it over. Every vehicle on the track is up for grabs. If it moves, it\u2019s fair game, but you don't have to play fair.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349140/extras/ab1e6d262f3c73a4f77bed4bcf41de34.avif?t=1751264125\" data-has-big width=800 height=49 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race down massive hills packed with ramps, hazards, and destructible scenery. Cars crumple, explode, and lose wheels in the chaos (but don\u2019t worry, raccoons are surprisingly durable).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349140/extras/ba6fa297fd716be8fce20455776f0f8b.avif?t=1751264125\" data-has-big width=800 height=49 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to drive a single car in team modes or go head-to-head. Launch from one vehicle to another, cling to rival cars, or hijack someone\u2019s ride mid-race. Winning is great, but causing mayhem is better.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349140/extras/8346cb54bfa6be5ff8bbdb3b735029ba.avif?t=1751264125\" data-has-big width=800 height=49 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crashing the party (literally) is <i>Wrecker</i>, a brutal private police force contracted to shut down races at any cost. These guys don\u2019t mess around. They'll ram you off the road, block your paths, and fire all kinds of &quot;non-lethal&quot; deterrents your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Whether you\u2019re racing for glory, causing <i>crash panda-</i>monium, or just trying to survive the next Wrecker ambush, every match is a ridiculous raccoon ruckus.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349140/extras/1e2f821358f3ea569d344b6c77041492.avif?t=1751264125\" data-has-big width=800 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Crash Pandas</i> is inspired by the original one-page TTRPG \u201cCrash Pandas\u201d by Grant Howitt, adapted with permission under Creative Commons.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349140/extras/1c211d9f3851ca389f8f05615bb2617b.avif?t=1751264125\" data-has-big width=800 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349140/extras/d953a1406e9ec38a125b08122e8738de.avif?t=1751264125\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Crash Pandas</i>, you play as speed-loving raccoons hijacking cars and racing through chaotic downhill streets. Fight for control of vehicles, sabotage your friends, and dodge the ruthless Wrecker authorities in fast-paced party-racing mayhem online or on the couch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349140/extras/5193650e62c1cdb45f28fdaa775f5729.avif?t=1751264125\" data-has-big width=800 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop into any car you find (or kick out another raccoon) to take it over. Every vehicle on the track is up for grabs. If it moves, it\u2019s fair game, but you don't have to play fair.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349140/extras/ab1e6d262f3c73a4f77bed4bcf41de34.avif?t=1751264125\" data-has-big width=800 height=49 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race down massive hills packed with ramps, hazards, and destructible scenery. Cars crumple, explode, and lose wheels in the chaos (but don\u2019t worry, raccoons are surprisingly durable).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349140/extras/ba6fa297fd716be8fce20455776f0f8b.avif?t=1751264125\" data-has-big width=800 height=49 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to drive a single car in team modes or go head-to-head. Launch from one vehicle to another, cling to rival cars, or hijack someone\u2019s ride mid-race. Winning is great, but causing mayhem is better.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349140/extras/8346cb54bfa6be5ff8bbdb3b735029ba.avif?t=1751264125\" data-has-big width=800 height=49 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crashing the party (literally) is <i>Wrecker</i>, a brutal private police force contracted to shut down races at any cost. These guys don\u2019t mess around. They'll ram you off the road, block your paths, and fire all kinds of &quot;non-lethal&quot; deterrents your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Whether you\u2019re racing for glory, causing <i>crash panda-</i>monium, or just trying to survive the next Wrecker ambush, every match is a ridiculous raccoon ruckus.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349140/extras/1e2f821358f3ea569d344b6c77041492.avif?t=1751264125\" data-has-big width=800 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Crash Pandas</i> is inspired by the original one-page TTRPG \u201cCrash Pandas\u201d by Grant Howitt, adapted with permission under Creative Commons.</p>",
    "short_description": "Hijack cars and race to the finish as chaotic raccoons in this physics-based party racer! Every vehicle is up for grabs as you battle for control, sabotage rivals, and dodge relentless authorities. Online or local multiplayer!",
